the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base liquid_federation includes these resources:
    temporal.

the templates are:
    the coin can be spent.
    the coin was confirmed at the time *a time*; scenario element.
    the spending transaction is at the time *a time*; scenario element.
    the coin has been confirmed for *a number* seconds.
    the witness contains a signature by *a key*; scenario element.
    the public key of *a key* is *a text*.

the knowledge base liquid_federation includes:

