% The spending paths of the policy.
rule federation with provenance the Bitcoin Core wallet Miniscript tests,
        confer "Liquid-like federated pegin with emergency recovery keys":
the coin can be spent if
    the witness contains a signature by functionary 1
    and the witness contains a signature by functionary 2
    and the witness contains a signature by functionary 3
    and the witness contains a signature by functionary 4
    and the witness contains a signature by functionary 5.

rule emergency with provenance the Bitcoin Core wallet Miniscript tests,
        confer "Liquid-like federated pegin with emergency recovery keys":
the coin can be spent if
    a number N is the count of each K such that
        a key K is in [emergency key 1, emergency key 2, emergency key 3]
        and the witness contains a signature by K
    and N >= 2
    and the coin has been confirmed for a number M seconds
    and M >= 7889408.

% The age of the coin, which the relative timelocks (older) measure.
rule coin_age_in_seconds:
the coin has been confirmed for a number N seconds if
    the coin was confirmed at the time a time T
    and the spending transaction is at the time a time M
    and N = M - T.

